abstract: "Python pipeline that turns scientific publications in Markdown into a linked Obsidian vault — spaCy (en_core_web_md) extracts people, organizations, concepts, and technologies, NetworkX builds the graph, and the CLI writes cross-linked Entities, Topics, and Publications notes plus JSON graph data."
